B.S3=s(["Hi\xe7 kimse tan\u0131kl\u0131ktan \xe7ekinemez.","Taraflardan birinin ni\u015fanl\u0131s\u0131 veya belirli derecedeki h\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131 tan\u0131kl\u0131ktan \xe7ekinebilir.","Tan\u0131kl\u0131ktan yaln\u0131zca kamu g\xf6revlileri \xe7ekinebilir.","Tan\u0131kl\u0131ktan \xe7ekinme yaln\u0131zca ceza davalar\u0131nda m\xfcmk\xfcnd\xfcr."],t.s)
